@startuml COMP-SEQ04
!include ../_theme.puml
title COMP-SEQ04 UC04 视频审核与发布（组件级）

actor "审核员 / 管理员" as Reviewer
participant "AdminVideosPage" as Page
participant "videoApi / Axios" as Api
participant "Gin Router" as Router
participant "AuthMiddleware / StaffMiddleware" as Middleware
participant "AdminListHandler / AdminUpdateStatusHandler" as Handler
database "MySQL" as DB
participant "本地文件系统" as FS

Reviewer -> Page: 打开审核页并筛选投稿
Page -> Api: videoApi.adminList(params)
Api -> Router: GET /api/v1/admin/videos
Router -> Middleware: 校验令牌与 staff 角色
alt 权限有效
  Middleware -> Handler: AdminListHandler(context)
  Handler -> DB: 查询视频、作者、状态和分页
  DB --> Handler: 投稿列表
  Handler --> Page: 返回审核列表
else 无权限
  Middleware --> Page: HTTP 401 / 403
end

Reviewer -> Page: 选择 approved 或 rejected
Page -> Api: videoApi.adminUpdateStatus(id, status)
Api -> Router: PUT /api/v1/admin/videos/:id/status
Router -> Middleware: 再次校验令牌与 staff 角色
Middleware -> Handler: AdminUpdateStatusHandler(context)
Handler -> Handler: 校验视频 ID 与状态
alt 状态为 approved
  Handler -> DB: 查询 video_url
  alt video_url 为空
    Handler -> FS: 检查 videos/:id/upload.*
    FS --> Handler: 未上传 / 仍在转码
    Handler --> Page: HTTP 403 和具体原因
  else 已存在播放地址
    Handler -> DB: Update status=approved
    DB --> Handler: 更新结果
    Handler --> Page: 返回最新状态
  end
else 状态为 pending 或 rejected
  Handler -> DB: Update status
  DB --> Handler: 更新结果 / 未找到
  Handler --> Page: HTTP 200 / 404 / 500
end
@enduml
